000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          TRMCORR.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        11/26/84.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*
001100*    THIS IS THE CORRECTION TO BANBURY EXPLOSION PROGRAM.
001200*    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO CORRECT ANY ERRORS FOUND ON THE
001300*    BANBURY EXPLOSION ERROR REPORT.  IT CALLS THE SUBPROGRAM
001400*    "TIRSNGL", THE SINGLE ISSUE/RETURN FROM STORES PROGRAM.
001500*    THE ONLY ACTUAL DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THE BANBURY CORRECTIONS
001600*    AND A NORMAL ISSUE OR RETURN IS THAT THE PRODUCTION DATE OF
001700*    THE BANBURY PRODUCTION BEING CORRECTED IS ENTERED ON
001800*    THE SCREEN.  THIS PRODUCTION DATE IS PLACED IN THE WORKORDER
001900*    FIELD IN THE TRANSACTION - KEYING THE CUTOFF PROGRAM
002000*    "XCDLYABS" THAT THIS CORRECTION IS FOR THE SPECIFIED PROD.
002100*    DATE.  THIS IS USED TO UPDATE USAGE, AND FOR SPECIAL MONTH-
002200*    END PROCESSING.  CIH.
002300*
002400*    ON JANUARY 21, 1985, ADDED A DUMMY PARAMETER TO THE CALL
002500*    OF THE SUBPROGRAM "TMTLSTAT" - MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY.
002600*    THIS IS A DUMMY CORPORATE CODE PARAMETER - USED BY PROGRAMS
002700*    THAT MAY PASS THE CORP CODE TO THE INQUIRY, THUS BYPASSING
002800*    THE CORPORATE CODE ENTRY SCREEN.  IF THE PASSED CODE IS SPACES,
002900*    THE CODE ENTRY SCREEN IS BROUGHT, AND THE CODE PARAMETER IS
003000*    IGNORED.  CIH.
003100*
003200*
003300*
003400*   10/ 8/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
003500*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
003600*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
003700*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
003800*             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
003900*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
004000*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
004100*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
004200*                                         PD RAGLOW.         *
      *C
      *C   25FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
004300**************************************************************
004400
004600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
004900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
005000
005100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZRMCORR-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

005200 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(1500).

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
005300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005400
005500 77  SAVE-LASTKEY                 PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
005600 77  SUB                          PIC 9(1)  VALUE 0.
005700 77  SAVE-PGM-KEY                 PIC X(3).
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE              PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".
005800
005900**************************************************************
006000**                                                          **
006100**          S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A                   **
006200**                                                          **
